[210.085363, "o", "    \"answer\": \"Lopinavir-Ritonavir is administered orally and must be taken with food (for the oral solution). The recommended dosage regimen for adults is either 400 mg lopinavir / 100 mg ritonavir twice daily, or 800 mg lopinavir / 200 mg ritonavir once daily.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
